sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: fleet maintenance redesign 2026-11-03, topology templates plan point 5 (one case per chart path, case files beside charts).
  %% status: draft
  %% command: test:run
  %% kind: test.run
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane I icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  %% lane C icon=server pill=target tone=purple
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant I as Incus host<br/>holds templates
  participant C as Clones<br/>Gateway, dev, prod
  CLI->>GW: test:run 3f2a9c1
  %%> Command:
  %%> - `orbit test:run 3f2a9c1`
  %%> - syntax: `<commit> [--all] [--idempotency-key=KEY] [--json]`
  Note over GW: Pick the cases<br/>task #5200
  %%> Which cases:
  %%> - the cases of every command whose chart, workflow or playbook the commit changes
  %%> - every case when the commit changes `recipe.json`
  %%> Groups:
  %%> - cases that only add or read share one clone; a case marked `own clone` gets its own
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-test-run
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5200
  SW->>I: Clone the templates<br/>incus copy · one per group
  %%> Why clones:
  %%> - copy-on-write from the template snapshots takes seconds, and every group starts from the same state
  SW->>C: Converge to the commit<br/>release · swamp load · converge
  %%> Why:
  %%> - the templates hold the last refreshed release; this applies only the difference to the commit under test
  SW->>C: Run the cases<br/>orbit <command> per case
  %%> How:
  %%> - each group runs its cases in order on its own clone; groups run in parallel
  SW->>C: Check every case<br/>doctor · second run
  %%> Passes when:
  %%> - Doctor reports zero drift for the records the case touched, and a second run changes nothing
  %%> - an error case is refused and changes nothing
  SW->>I: Delete the clones
  %%> When:
  %%> - always, also after a failure
  Note over SW: Report the check run<br/>GitHub check · head SHA
  %%> How:
  %%> - with the token the Gateway minted at admission; also after a failure
  %%> - a required check, so a red run blocks the merge, Renovate's included
  alt every case passes
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded
    Note over GW: Record each case<br/>check: passed
  else a case fails
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>failed cases · logs
    Note over GW: Record each case<br/>check: failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5200
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
